CORE
main.c
--datarace --no-assertions --no-por --unwind 2 --rounds 2
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^BDD prune: removed 1 shared accesses with a contradictory guard
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The thread writes g only under c && !c, through two separately named guards,
so the expression simplifier keeps the write; as BDDs the guard is false and
the write is removed before the encoding.
